    "notes": "GPIO26-32 carry SPI flash/PSRAM on every module. On octal (OPI) flash/PSRAM modules (WROOM-1 N16R8/N8R8, WROOM-2) GPIO33-37 are also used and are 'not available for external use'. Quad modules leave 33-37 free; we keep them caution at chip level, and an octal board must list 35-37 (and any broken-out 33/34) as never."
